[
 {
  "id": "I-1",
  "canto": "Canto I",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.208,
    "seconds": 14.6,
    "lines": [
     "Today I woke up strange. As if my body",
     "were rented, and I an intruder. A",
     "foreign body."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1231,
    "burnOut": 0.342,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.208,
    "to": 0.3717,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "My heart was not mine. I only",
     "carried it."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.3717,
    "to": 0.6716,
    "seconds": 21.1,
    "lines": [
     "And how I trembled before lucidity. It was my",
     "greatest horror. I would have given anything",
     "not to lodge it. But even so it scratched at",
     "the walls of my head."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0854,
    "burnOut": 0.2373,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.6716,
    "to": 0.9573,
    "seconds": 20.1,
    "lines": [
     "Lucidity made my heart a burden. A bag",
     "of flesh on my back. And the more I",
     "dragged it, the heavier the trail",
     "grew, of earth, of gravel, of ground."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.0897,
    "burnOut": 0.2491,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.35,
   -4.3,
   -8.95,
   -13.6
  ],
  "moves": {
   "double": 0.8,
   "pulse": 0.5,
   "erase": 0.4,
   "afterimage": 0.5
  },
  "seconds": 70.3
 },
 {
  "id": "I-2",
  "canto": "Canto I",
  "mark": "**",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.2563,
    "seconds": 14.3,
    "lines": [
     "The more I think about what makes me,",
     "me. The less I understand of that",
     "substance."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1263,
    "burnOut": 0.3508,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.2563,
    "to": 0.5207,
    "seconds": 14.7,
    "lines": [
     "I know I feel more than I can bear.",
     "But my flesh draws borders too far for",
     "me to reach."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1224,
    "burnOut": 0.3399,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.5207,
    "to": 0.7393,
    "seconds": 12.2,
    "lines": [
     "And I lock myself inside out.",
     "I have no house. I am a host."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.148,
    "burnOut": 0.4111,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.7393,
    "to": 0.9461,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "A true parasite."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.35,
   -4.3,
   -8.95,
   -13.6
  ],
  "moves": {
   "double": 1.0,
   "press": 0.6,
   "stretch": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 55.6
 },
 {
  "id": "I-3",
  "canto": "Canto I",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.2538,
    "seconds": 18.8,
    "lines": [
     "I lie down warm, but slowly I go cold.",
     "And even when winter ends. And the",
     "cold leaves me. I hold on to its",
     "cloak. I forbid it to go."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.0957,
    "burnOut": 0.266,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.2538,
    "to": 0.45,
    "seconds": 14.5,
    "lines": [
     "I spread its needles over my body. And",
     "in the shiver of each puncture, I warm",
     "myself."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1239,
    "burnOut": 0.3442,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.45,
    "to": 0.6474,
    "seconds": 14.6,
    "lines": [
     "I make the ice cover the sun. Until",
     "the light goes cold. Leaving only",
     "preserved flesh."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1231,
    "burnOut": 0.342,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.6474,
    "to": 0.8042,
    "seconds": 11.6,
    "lines": [
     "But it does not obey me. It",
     "slips through my fingers."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1549,
    "burnOut": 0.4304,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.8042,
    "to": 0.9595,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "It rejects me."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.8,
   -3.4,
   -7.6,
   -11.8,
   -16.0
  ],
  "moves": {
   "cold": 1.0,
   "swarm": 0.7,
   "erase": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 74.1
 },
 {
  "id": "I-4",
  "canto": "Canto I",
  "mark": "****",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.3365,
    "seconds": 13.7,
    "lines": [
     "And inside this flesh there is earth.",
     "Where worms feed in the womb of death."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1313,
    "burnOut": 0.3647,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.3365,
    "to": 0.6188,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "They make mud where I sink. It",
     "is my ecosystem."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.6188,
    "to": 0.9264,
    "seconds": 12.5,
    "lines": [
     "A liquid shadow that seeps",
     "into the soil and lets nothing",
     "grow."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1437,
    "burnOut": 0.3991,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "sink": 1.0,
   "swarm": 0.8,
   "press": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 40.7
 },
 {
  "id": "I-5",
  "canto": "Canto I",
  "mark": "*****",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.2527,
    "seconds": 13.9,
    "lines": [
     "And when my throat vibrates in the",
     "vacuum like the string of a satanic",
     "guitar."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1296,
    "burnOut": 0.3599,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.2527,
    "to": 0.527,
    "seconds": 15.1,
    "lines": [
     "Words I will never be able to say",
     "pursue me. Something is being lost.",
     "Getting farther away."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1194,
    "burnOut": 0.3317,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.527,
    "to": 0.7362,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "And amnesia seduces me, makes",
     "me drowsy."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.7362,
    "to": 0.9454,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Makes my eyes close inside me."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.35,
   -4.3,
   -8.95,
   -13.6
  ],
  "moves": {
   "erase": 1.0,
   "stretch": 0.6,
   "cold": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 55.0
 },
 {
  "id": "II-1",
  "canto": "Canto II",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.3072,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "I was expelled from my body.",
     "From where I suck life."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1562,
    "burnOut": 0.4338,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.3072,
    "to": 0.6136,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Suiciding the man for the boy.",
     "I abandon the truth."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.6136,
    "to": 0.9201,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "I abandon myself."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "double": 1.0,
   "erase": 0.6,
   "tilt": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 37.5
 },
 {
  "id": "II-2",
  "canto": "Canto II",
  "mark": "**",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.1624,
    "seconds": 13.5,
    "lines": [
     "I spend my days locked in my room.",
     "watching my flesh blend into the",
     "walls."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1331,
    "burnOut": 0.3696,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.1624,
    "to": 0.3005,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Tears run down the peeling",
     "paint."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.3005,
    "to": 0.4498,
    "seconds": 12.4,
    "lines": [
     "There is no outside. There is",
     "only hunger. In a greenish",
     "dark."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1447,
    "burnOut": 0.402,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.4498,
    "to": 0.6406,
    "seconds": 15.9,
    "lines": [
     "And the hyenas, crocodiles and",
     "vultures feed there. But my blood has",
     "already dried. Still they bite."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1133,
    "burnOut": 0.3146,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.6406,
    "to": 0.8259,
    "seconds": 15.4,
    "lines": [
     "They cut the fibres so as not to",
     "forget. Sinking their fangs until they",
     "die, until they forget."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1166,
    "burnOut": 0.3239,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "from": 0.8259,
    "to": 0.964,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Hunger will win."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   1.1,
   -2.8,
   -6.7,
   -10.6,
   -14.5,
   -18.4
  ],
  "moves": {
   "press": 1.0,
   "swarm": 0.8,
   "erase": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 83.3
 },
 {
  "id": "II-3",
  "canto": "Canto II",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.4996,
    "seconds": 27.9,
    "lines": [
     "Under the blanket for two eternities. I wake",
     "without getting up. Crucified on the bed.",
     "There is no heaven. There is only hell, high",
     "up. The bed opens its mouth, and the pillow",
     "bites. Pierces my skull, which leaks a",
     "tasteless liquid."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0645,
    "burnOut": 0.1793,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.4996,
    "to": 0.7403,
    "seconds": 13.4,
    "lines": [
     "All the vertebrae, viscera and ribs",
     "are a pile of parts that do not work."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.134,
    "burnOut": 0.3721,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.7403,
    "to": 0.9463,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "And my heart does not beat, it",
     "coughs."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "tilt": 1.0,
   "press": 0.7,
   "sink": 0.5
  },
  "seconds": 55.8
 },
 {
  "id": "II-4",
  "canto": "Canto II",
  "mark": "****",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.0956,
    "seconds": 13.2,
    "lines": [
     "The drool builds up, poisoning",
     "all the calm that only the",
     "lonely know."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1367,
    "burnOut": 0.3798,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.0956,
    "to": 0.213,
    "seconds": 16.2,
    "lines": [
     "The disease I contracted in the womb",
     "has no remedy, but with each day that",
     "passes I walk toward a cure."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1114,
    "burnOut": 0.3093,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.213,
    "to": 0.3033,
    "seconds": 12.4,
    "lines": [
     "I let the shadow walk ahead of",
     "me. Let my feet court the",
     "dark."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1447,
    "burnOut": 0.402,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.3033,
    "to": 0.4339,
    "seconds": 18.0,
    "lines": [
     "And at this crossroads, I meet Satan",
     "in the middle of the road, having lost",
     "his way. We walk hand in hand, toward",
     "the cure."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1001,
    "burnOut": 0.2781,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.4339,
    "to": 0.5447,
    "seconds": 15.3,
    "lines": [
     "The coffin is my bed. It is the cross",
     "I hesitate to call mine. But I lie",
     "down with open arms."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.118,
    "burnOut": 0.3278,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "from": 0.5447,
    "to": 0.7116,
    "seconds": 23.0,
    "lines": [
     "A crack comes to deceive the light. It",
     "refracts from afar in a sombre immensity like",
     "a shy little girl. Scratch the wood's",
     "entrails! try! But I am so thirsty that I",
     "drink thirst."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0783,
    "burnOut": 0.2176,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b7",
    "from": 0.7116,
    "to": 0.7951,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Thirst is my water."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b8",
    "from": 0.7951,
    "to": 0.8947,
    "seconds": 13.7,
    "lines": [
     "The head tries to rise, the body will",
     "not let it. They tear the dark matter."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1313,
    "burnOut": 0.3647,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b9",
    "from": 0.8947,
    "to": 0.9782,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Half is death, the other too."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   1.6,
   -1.8,
   -5.2,
   -8.6,
   -12.0,
   -15.4,
   -18.8,
   -22.2,
   -25.6
  ],
  "moves": {
   "sink": 0.8,
   "stretch": 0.7,
   "cold": 0.5,
   "double": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 137.7
 },
 {
  "id": "III-1",
  "canto": "Canto III",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.8799,
    "seconds": 22.0,
    "lines": [
     "I am leaking. Leaking out of myself. I am not",
     "a human thing. I am a broth. A thin broth.",
     "Two. None. Kneaded from a substance of mine,",
     "but unknown. Seeping into myself."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0819,
    "burnOut": 0.2275,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -6.4
  ],
  "moves": {
   "sink": 1.0,
   "erase": 0.8
  },
  "seconds": 25.0
 },
 {
  "id": "III-2",
  "canto": "Canto III",
  "mark": "**",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.2977,
    "seconds": 15.9,
    "lines": [
     "I dig to fit, to the sound of",
     "footsteps from the world above. They",
     "follow something I cannot follow."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1133,
    "burnOut": 0.3146,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.2977,
    "to": 0.7283,
    "seconds": 23.0,
    "lines": [
     "And when the sound of the footsteps drifts off",
     "to sleep. I am afraid to close my eyes. Here",
     "where stars die, and space stretches. The",
     "light is limp. It is the portrait of a hole."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0783,
    "burnOut": 0.2176,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.7283,
    "to": 0.9438,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "And nothing touches nothing."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "stretch": 1.0,
   "cold": 0.8,
   "swarm": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 53.4
 },
 {
  "id": "III-3",
  "canto": "Canto III",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.4867,
    "seconds": 15.0,
    "lines": [
     "And it is no longer I who acts. I live",
     "inside an idea. A stitch in the lobe",
     "of the corpse."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1201,
    "burnOut": 0.3337,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.4867,
    "to": 0.9025,
    "seconds": 12.8,
    "lines": [
     "That suture is the only thing",
     "that binds me to the rightful",
     "owner."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1406,
    "burnOut": 0.3906,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -1.9,
   -8.8
  ],
  "moves": {
   "erase": 0.7,
   "double": 0.6,
   "stretch": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 30.8
 },
 {
  "id": "IV-1",
  "canto": "Canto IV",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.3825,
    "seconds": 32.3,
    "lines": [
     "And when the earth pulses. Swallowing a thin longing.",
     "I miss missing. But the memory is white. It is",
     "strange. Borrowed from another whom I fear. The",
     "remembrance comes in the small hours while my hair",
     "fuses with the threads of the mattress, and moans near",
     "me like an animal in heat."
    ],
    "width": 56,
    "fadeIn": 0.0556,
    "burnOut": 0.1546,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.3825,
    "to": 0.5565,
    "seconds": 14.7,
    "lines": [
     "While he sleeps, I can see the dark.",
     "And try to reach something that was",
     "coming slowly."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1224,
    "burnOut": 0.3399,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.5565,
    "to": 0.6925,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "But he wakes, before I arrive.",
     "And I no longer see."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.6925,
    "to": 0.8285,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "I see nothing."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.8285,
    "to": 0.9645,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Not even nothing."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.8,
   -3.4,
   -7.6,
   -11.8,
   -16.0
  ],
  "moves": {
   "afterimage": 1.0,
   "cold": 0.5,
   "stretch": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 84.6
 },
 {
  "id": "IV-2",
  "canto": "Canto IV",
  "mark": "**",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.5271,
    "seconds": 16.2,
    "lines": [
     "The addiction to oxygen leaves me",
     "breathless. The dead breeze I swallow",
     "dry makes the still wind thick."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1114,
    "burnOut": 0.3093,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.5271,
    "to": 0.9022,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "A translucent poison."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -1.9,
   -8.8
  ],
  "moves": {
   "press": 0.9,
   "cold": 0.7,
   "swarm": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 30.7
 },
 {
  "id": "IV-3",
  "canto": "Canto IV",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.196,
    "seconds": 16.5,
    "lines": [
     "And this time I caress fingers soaked",
     "in delirium. Delirium sucks my soul. I",
     "can dry out, stop the seepage."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1089,
    "burnOut": 0.3025,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.196,
    "to": 0.4913,
    "seconds": 24.9,
    "lines": [
     "I bite lips full of trickery. I drain the",
     "drool with a kiss on my face. Until nothing",
     "makes a word anymore. Delirium made, out of",
     "nothing, a something. And how delicious is the",
     "soft flesh of a ghost."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0723,
    "burnOut": 0.2009,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.4913,
    "to": 0.9644,
    "seconds": 39.9,
    "lines": [
     "But my hunger is not sated. It deforms my brain. Bends",
     "my nerves. Makes me eat the remains of an insect. It",
     "fell into my mouth while I slept. Dove into a deep",
     "dark. Its larvae will die soon. What guilt would I",
     "feel? But I do. Before the absolute rot I cannot not",
     "feel. I ate an insect. Crushed it between my teeth,",
     "swallowed its slime, and at last there was taste."
    ],
    "width": 56,
    "fadeIn": 0.0451,
    "burnOut": 0.1253,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "swarm": 1.0,
   "pulse": 0.6,
   "tilt": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 84.3
 },
 {
  "id": "IV-4",
  "canto": "Canto IV",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.7744,
    "seconds": 51.4,
    "lines": [
     "And today I fall in love with ugliness. I never",
     "understood why others are so afraid of it. Ugliness is",
     "not ugly. If loving were beautiful, beautiful would be",
     "ugly. To love something is grotesque. It is beautiful.",
     "It is in ugliness that I find love. And I am not",
     "afraid. I have passion. In an immensity of horror. I",
     "love being horrible. I smile with yellow teeth, and",
     "drink from a dirty spring. I drink ugly. And even if",
     "no one loves me, I choose ugliness. An ugly thing, but",
     "one I recognise."
    ],
    "width": 56,
    "fadeIn": 0.035,
    "burnOut": 0.0972,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.7744,
    "to": 0.9548,
    "seconds": 12.0,
    "lines": [
     "There is something divine in",
     "the ugly. Like a sharp dark."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1502,
    "burnOut": 0.4173,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -1.9,
   -8.8
  ],
  "moves": {
   "pulse": 0.8,
   "erase": 0.3
  },
  "seconds": 66.4
 },
 {
  "id": "IV-5",
  "canto": "Canto IV",
  "mark": "****",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.8744,
    "seconds": 20.9,
    "lines": [
     "And everything that was new became a little",
     "less new. I am afraid nothing recent will be",
     "left. That I will become the sterile past of",
     "parents and children."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0862,
    "burnOut": 0.2393,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -6.4
  ],
  "moves": {
   "erase": 0.9,
   "stretch": 0.5,
   "cold": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 23.9
 },
 {
  "id": "V-1",
  "canto": "Canto V",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.1077,
    "seconds": 14.0,
    "lines": [
     "But a lucid dream ends too. And one",
     "day the friction of the air warmed my",
     "face."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1287,
    "burnOut": 0.3576,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.1077,
    "to": 0.2216,
    "seconds": 14.8,
    "lines": [
     "For the first time my forehead scraped",
     "the asphalt that before only my feet",
     "had touched."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1216,
    "burnOut": 0.3378,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.2216,
    "to": 0.3223,
    "seconds": 13.1,
    "lines": [
     "Before, I did not bleed. Not a",
     "drop. But everything changed",
     "with you."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1377,
    "burnOut": 0.3825,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.3223,
    "to": 0.4713,
    "seconds": 19.3,
    "lines": [
     "I stuffed crumbs of my spirit. Of",
     "malnourished dough. Into the mouth of",
     "my parasite sister. We dined in the",
     "dry womb, soaked in discharge."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.093,
    "burnOut": 0.2585,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.4713,
    "to": 0.628,
    "seconds": 20.3,
    "lines": [
     "When I cut off my arm and handed it to",
     "you. You slid the severed flesh",
     "between your thighs. For each finger",
     "of mine to take on an extremity of",
     "yours."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.0885,
    "burnOut": 0.2458,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "from": 0.628,
    "to": 0.7307,
    "seconds": 13.3,
    "lines": [
     "And you tore a whisper from my ear, as",
     "if it had never left your throat:"
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1349,
    "burnOut": 0.3747,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b7",
    "from": 0.7307,
    "to": 0.8552,
    "seconds": 16.2,
    "lines": [
     "\"Tonight I want you to crawl across",
     "the room, to my bed, and wrap yourself",
     "around my skin like a sheet."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1114,
    "burnOut": 0.3093,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b8",
    "from": 0.8552,
    "to": 0.9769,
    "seconds": 15.8,
    "lines": [
     "And then, little brother, I will nurse",
     "you like a baby of blood, and let you",
     "bite until you choke.\""
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1139,
    "burnOut": 0.3165,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   1.48,
   -2.05,
   -5.57,
   -9.1,
   -12.62,
   -16.15,
   -19.68,
   -23.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "double": 1.0,
   "pulse": 0.8,
   "afterimage": 0.4
  },
  "seconds": 129.9
 },
 {
  "id": "V-2",
  "canto": "Canto V",
  "mark": "**",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.3063,
    "seconds": 22.6,
    "lines": [
     "Only you were able to ease the crown that",
     "crushed me. I, of all people, who bit only to",
     "wear down my teeth, rubbed my tongue between",
     "your molars, addicted to the white slime."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0796,
    "burnOut": 0.2211,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.3063,
    "to": 0.4685,
    "seconds": 12.0,
    "lines": [
     "And even if something was",
     "lost. I found it. You found",
     "it."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1502,
    "burnOut": 0.4173,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.4685,
    "to": 0.6242,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "I understood how a soul",
     "stretches."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.6242,
    "to": 0.8037,
    "seconds": 13.3,
    "lines": [
     "And the whole world will die without",
     "discovering what it is to love me."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1358,
    "burnOut": 0.3772,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.8037,
    "to": 0.9594,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Except you, who ate this",
     "strange flesh."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   0.8,
   -3.4,
   -7.6,
   -11.8,
   -16.0
  ],
  "moves": {
   "pulse": 1.0,
   "double": 0.7
  },
  "seconds": 73.9
 },
 {
  "id": "V-3",
  "canto": "Canto V",
  "mark": "***",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.3994,
    "seconds": 22.2,
    "lines": [
     "But we sang our dead tongue, inherited from",
     "ancestral silence. Strings wounded the sterile",
     "wood, and our calluses fused living flesh with",
     "mad words, in a cannibal choir."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.0812,
    "burnOut": 0.2256,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.3994,
    "to": 0.6743,
    "seconds": 15.3,
    "lines": [
     "Where did the violin end? Where did",
     "the piano begin? We composed the score",
     "of our extinction."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.118,
    "burnOut": 0.3278,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.6743,
    "to": 0.9459,
    "seconds": 15.1,
    "lines": [
     "And all we could do was bow hand in",
     "hand for a curtain to decapitate, and",
     "Death to applaud."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1194,
    "burnOut": 0.3317,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -0.4,
   -5.8,
   -11.2
  ],
  "moves": {
   "stretch": 0.8,
   "afterimage": 0.7,
   "tilt": 0.5
  },
  "seconds": 55.5
 },
 {
  "id": "V-4",
  "canto": "Canto V",
  "mark": "****",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.6565,
    "seconds": 27.7,
    "lines": [
     "One day the flowers withered on the grave. The",
     "trampled grass turned to sludge and not even",
     "the footprint could be seen. The headstone was",
     "swallowed. And drops erased the epitaph of a",
     "promise. Of the lie they told the salted soil."
    ],
    "width": 48,
    "fadeIn": 0.065,
    "burnOut": 0.1804,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.85,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.6565,
    "to": 0.9289,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Two holes do not fill."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
  "stations": [
   5.0,
   -1.9,
   -8.8
  ],
  "moves": {
   "sink": 1.0,
   "cold": 0.8,
   "erase": 0.5
  },
  "seconds": 42.2
 },
 {
  "id": "VI-1",
  "canto": "Canto VI",
  "mark": "*",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "from": 0.0,
    "to": 0.1711,
    "seconds": 12.0,
    "lines": [
     "From a time pregnant with",
     "pleasure, a soft yolk was",
     "born."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1502,
    "burnOut": 0.4173,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "from": 0.1711,
    "to": 0.3353,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "How can the weight of nothing",
     "be so hard to carry?"
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "from": 0.3353,
    "to": 0.5855,
    "seconds": 17.5,
    "lines": [
     "And this weight slowly spread through",
     "my whole body, as if I had lain down",
     "wrong. And even the silence seemed",
     "quieter."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1027,
    "burnOut": 0.2853,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "from": 0.5855,
    "to": 0.793,
    "seconds": 14.5,
    "lines": [
     "If I opened my chest, I would still",
     "see you there. But I would see you",
     "slipping away."
    ],
    "width": 40,
    "fadeIn": 0.1239,
    "burnOut": 0.3442,
    "x": -3.45,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "from": 0.793,
    "to": 0.9572,
    "seconds": 11.5,
    "lines": [
     "Now my face is cold. You went."
    ],
    "width": 32,
    "fadeIn": 0.1565,
    "burnOut": 0.4348,
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 1.55,
    "anchor": "left"
   }
  ],
